Value Required INSTANCE (\d+)
Value List NUM_INTF (\d+)

# Guard of the OSPF families (feature 011, research R14): one row per OSPF instance, which only
# proves OSPF runs, with the interface count of each of its areas. The "no OSPF" document
# ({"vrfs": {}}) is matched by the recipe's nothing_pattern and yields no row here. The pack has no
# JSON parser and none is added: keys are matched by name, not by indentation.
Start
  ^\s+"instanceId": -> Continue.Record
  ^\s+"instanceId": ${INSTANCE},?$$
  ^\s+"numIntf": ${NUM_INTF},?$$
